# SentinelGPT public-demo edge (SRS Chapter 12, Sections 1 & 3).
# SITE_ADDRESS env var selects the site name; a real DNS domain switches on
# automatic HTTPS/Let's Encrypt. API traffic is matched before the SPA fallback.

{$SITE_ADDRESS::80} {
	reverse_proxy /api/* api:8000
	reverse_proxy frontend:8080
}
